WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
01 · OVERVIEW: Prevent takeovers with layered everyday security. Most compromises exploit reused passwords or urgent social engineering links.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
02 · PASSPHRASES: Length & uniqueness beat tricky substitutions. Never reuse your email or banking password on secondary sites or forums.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
03 · PASSWORD VAULT: Password managers verify domains automatically. If you land on a look-alike scam URL, autofill stays silent—warning you.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
04 · ENABLE MFA: Authenticator MFA & backup codes block intruders. Never share a 6-digit OTP; real IT support or banks never ask for your code.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
05 · ANTI-PHISHING: Verify urgent alerts via a separate trusted channel. Ignore countdown threats; navigate independently via your own saved bookmark.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
06 · TRY IT: Check email/portal MFA & save offline backup codes. Enable screen locks and verify automatic browser security updates today.
